DESCRIPTION:Connect Beyond Festival is back for three days of music\, storytelling\, and immersive experiences at The Orange Peel in Asheville.\nThe 2026 festival brings together filmmakers\, musicians\, creatives\, and cultural voices for a weekend of live performances\, conversations\, and interactive installations\, including The Community Garden \, a large-scale venue-wide art exhibit where attendees actively engage with the experience. Event Details and Tickets
